Room fit: 4 ft deep sizes fit a 5 ft deep bay; 1.75 in sits a quarter inch above 1 in foam tiles plus turf, so plan the flush cut; Carl's sizes the room at 13 to 16 ft long for the 5 x 8 through 6 x 10
